          "description": "Momma Bear Audio collection of rhyming Christmas audio stories, where each tale is a delightful adventure told through rhyme. Perfect for those little listeners, these stories are easy to follow and full of fun. From a reindeer learning to fly to some silly candy canes, our stories are designed to entertain. Ideal for bedtime listening or anytime enjoyment, these stories are simple, fun and for everyone!",
